<title>USA: Gainesville ISD, Texas, won by A.G. Edwards.</title>
<headline>Gainesville ISD, Texas, won by A.G. Edwards.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards said it won $3.500 million of Gainesville ISD, Texas, school building bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.6498 percent.</p>
</text>
